#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:161
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Git"
msgstr "Instalação do \"Git\""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:164
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Git</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>Git</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:168
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr \\\n"
"            --with-gitconfig=/etc/gitconfig \\\n"
"            --with-python=python3 &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr \\\n"
"           --with-gitconfig=/etc/gitconfig \\\n"
"           --with-python=python3 &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:174
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You can build the man pages and/or html docs, or use downloaded ones. If you"
" choose to build them, use the next two instructions."
msgstr ""
"Você pode construir as páginas de manual e(ou) documentos \"HTML\" ou usar "
"os baixados. Se você decidir construí-los(as), [então] use as próximas duas "
"instruções."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:180
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have installed <xref linkend=\"asciidoc\"/> you can create the html "
"version of the man pages and other docs:"
msgstr ""
"Se você instalou <xref linkend=\"asciidoc\"/>, [então] você pode criar a "
"versão \"HTML\" das páginas de manual e outros documentos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:184
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make html</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make html</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:187
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have installed <xref linkend=\"asciidoc\"/> and <xref "
"linkend=\"xmlto\"/> you can create the man pages:"
msgstr ""
"Se você instalou <xref linkend=\"asciidoc\"/> e <xref linkend=\"xmlto\"/>, "
"[então] você pode criar as páginas de manual:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:191
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make man</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make man</userinput>"

#.  It looks like I'd misdiagnosed the issue.
#. phrase revision='systemd'>
#. One test named <literal>start and stop
#.       Linux/systemd maintenance</literal> is known to fail if the current
#.       login session is not started after rebuilding
#.       <xref linkend='systemd'/> with <xref linkend='linux-pam'/>
#.       support, or it's a SSH session but the SSH server is not configured
#.       with <option>UsePAM</option> enabled.</phrase
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:194
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The test suite can be run in parallel mode. To run the test suite, issue: "
"<command>make test -k |&amp; tee test.log</command>.  If some test fails, "
"the list of failed tests can be shown via <command>grep '^not ok' test.log |"
" grep -v TODO</command>."
msgstr ""
"A suíte de teste pode ser executada em modo paralelo. Para executar a suíte "
"de teste, emita: <command>make test -k &amp; tee test.log</command>. Se "
"algum teste falhar, a lista dos testes falhos pode ser mostrada via "
"<command>grep '^not ok' test.log | grep -v TODO</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:208
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:212
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make perllibdir=/usr/lib/perl5/&lfs-perl-version;/site_perl "
"install</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make perllibdir=/usr/lib/perl5/&lfs-perl-version;/site_perl "
"install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:215
#, xml-text
msgid "If you created the man pages and/or html docs"
msgstr "Se você criou as páginas de manual e(ou) documentos \"HTML\""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:218
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install the man pages as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Instale as páginas de manual como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:223
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install-man</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install-man</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:226
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install the html docs as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Instale os documentos \"HTML\" como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:231
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make htmldir=/usr/share/doc/git-&git-version; install-"
"html</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make htmldir=/usr/share/doc/git-&git-version; install-"
"html</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:234
#, xml-text
msgid "If you downloaded the man pages and/or html docs"
msgstr "Se você baixou as páginas de manual e(ou) documentos \"HTML\""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:237
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you downloaded the man pages untar them as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você baixou as páginas de manual, [então] descompacte-as como o(a) "
"usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:241
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>tar -xf ../git-manpages-&git-version;.tar.xz \\\n"
"    -C /usr/share/man --no-same-owner --no-overwrite-dir</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>tar -xf ../git-manpages-&git-version;.tar.xz \\\n"
"   -C /usr/share/man --no-same-owner --no-overwrite-dir</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:245
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you downloaded the html docs untar them as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você baixou os documentos \"HTML\", [então] descompacte-os como o(a) "
"usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:249
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir -vp   /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"tar   -xf   ../git-htmldocs-&git-version;.tar.xz \\\n"
"      -C    /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version; --no-same-owner --no-overwrite-dir &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"find        /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version; -type d -exec chmod 755 {} \\; &amp;&amp;\n"
"find        /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version; -type f -exec chmod 644 {} \\;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir -vp   /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"tar   -xf   ../git-htmldocs-&git-version;.tar.xz \\\n"
"     -C    /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version; --no-same-owner --no-overwrite-dir &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"find        /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version; -type d -exec chmod 755 {} \\; &amp;&amp;\n"
"find        /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version; -type f -exec chmod 644 {} \\;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:257
#, xml-text
msgid "Reorganize text and html in the html-docs (both methods)"
msgstr "Reorganize o texto e o \"HTML\" no \"html-docs\" (ambos os métodos)"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:260
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"For both methods, the html-docs include a lot of plain text files.  "
"Reorganize the files as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>"
" user:"
msgstr ""
"Para ambos os métodos, o \"html-docs\" inclue muitos arquivos planos de "
"texto. Reorganize os arquivos como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:265
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir -vp /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version;/man-pages/{html,text}         &amp;&amp;\n"
"mv        /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version;/{git*.txt,man-pages/text}     &amp;&amp;\n"
"mv        /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version;/{git*.,index.,man-pages/}html &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"mkdir -vp /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version;/technical/{html,text}         &amp;&amp;\n"
"mv        /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version;/technical/{*.txt,text}        &amp;&amp;\n"
"mv        /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version;/technical/{*.,}html           &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"mkdir -vp /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version;/howto/{html,text}             &amp;&amp;\n"
"mv        /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version;/howto/{*.txt,text}            &amp;&amp;\n"
"mv        /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version;/howto/{*.,}html               &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"sed -i '/^&lt;a href=/s|howto/|&amp;html/|' /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version;/howto-index.html &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed -i '/^\\* link:/s|howto/|&amp;html/|' /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version;/howto-index.txt</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir -vp /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version;/man-pages/{html,text}        &amp;&amp;\n"
"mv        /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version;/{git*.txt,man-pages/text}     &amp;&amp;\n"
"mv        /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version;/{git*.,index.,man-pages/}html &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"mkdir -vp /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version;/technical/{html,text}         &amp;&amp;\n"
"mv        /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version;/technical/{*.txt,text}        &amp;&amp;\n"
"mv        /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version;/technical/{*.,}html           &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"mkdir -vp /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version;/howto/{html,text}             &amp;&amp;\n"
"mv        /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version;/howto/{*.txt,text}            &amp;&amp;\n"
"mv        /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version;/howto/{*.,}html               &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"sed -i '/^&lt;a href=/s|howto/|&amp;html/|' /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version;/howto-index.html &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed -i '/^\\* link:/s|howto/|&amp;html/|' /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version;/howto-index.txt</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:283
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:286
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-gitconfig=/etc/gitconfig</parameter>: This sets "
"<filename>/etc/gitconfig</filename> as the file that stores the default, "
"system wide, <application>Git</application> settings."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-gitconfig=/etc/gitconfig</parameter>: Isso configura "
"<filename>/etc/gitconfig</filename> como o arquivo que armazena as "
"configurações padrão do <application>Git</application> abrangente a todo o "
"sistema."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:293
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-python=python3</parameter>: Use this switch to use "
"<application>Python 3</application>, instead of the EOL'ed "
"<application>Python 2</application>. Python is used for the <command>git "
"p4</command> interface to Perforce repositories, and also used in some "
"tests."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-python=python3</parameter>: Use esta chave para usar "
"<application>Python 3</application>, em vez do <application>Python "
"2</application> com \"EOL\". \"Python\" é usado para a interface "
"<command>git p4</command> para repositórios \"Perforce\" e também usado em "
"alguns testes."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:301
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--with-libpcre2</option>: Use this switch if "
"<application>PCRE2</application> is installed and has been built with the "
"non-default JIT enabled."
msgstr ""
"<option>--with-libpcre2</option>: Use essa chave se "
"<application>PCRE2</application> estiver instalado e tiver sido construído "
"com o \"JIT\" não padrão habilitado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:307
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--with-libpcre1</option>: As an alternative to PCRE2, use this "
"switch if the deprecated <application>PCRE</application> is installed and "
"has been built with the non-default JIT enabled."
msgstr ""
"<option>--with-libpcre1</option>: Como uma alternativa ao \"PCRE2\", use "
"essa chave se o obsoleto <application>PCRE</application> estiver instalado e"
" tiver sido construído com o \"JIT\" não padrão habilitado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:313
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>tar -xf ../git-manpages-&git-version;.tar.gz -C /usr/share/man "
"--no-same-owner</command>: This untars <filename>git-manpages-&git-"
"version;.tar.gz</filename>. The <option>-C</option> option makes tar change "
"directory to <filename class=\"directory\">/usr/share/man</filename> before "
"it starts to decompress the docs. The <option>--no-same-owner</option> "
"option stops tar from preserving the user and group details of the files. "
"This is useful as that user or group may not exist on your system; this "
"could (potentially) be a security risk."
msgstr ""
"<command>tar -xf ../git-manpages-&git-version;.tar.gz -C /usr/share/man "
"--no-same-owner</command>: Isso descompacta <filename>git-manpages-&git-"
"version;.tar.gz</filename>. A opção <option>-C</option> faz com que o "
"\"tar\" mude o diretório para <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/share/man</filename> antes de começar a "
"descomprimir os documentos. A opção <option>--no-same-owner</option> impede "
"que o \"tar\" preserve os detalhes de usuário(a) e de grupo dos arquivos. "
"Isso é útil porque esse(a) usuário(a) ou grupo possivelmente não exista em "
"seu sistema; isso poderia (potencialmente) ser um risco de segurança."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:325
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>mv /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version; ...</command>: These commands "
"move some of the files into subfolders to make it easier to sort through the"
" docs and find what you're looking for."
msgstr ""
"<command>mv /usr/share/doc/git-&git-version; ...</command>: Esses comandos "
"movem alguns dos arquivos para subpastas para tornar mais fácil a ordenação "
"ao longo dos documentos e achar o que você está procurando."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:331
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>find ... chmod ...</command>: These commands correct the "
"permissions in the shipped documentation tar file."
msgstr ""
"<command>find ... chmod ...</command>: Esses comandos corrigem as permissões"
" no arquivo \"tar\" da documentação enviada."

